#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Akiyama"
msgid "Hmm? What're you doing here?"
msgstr "¿Mmm? ¿Qué haces acá?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_キャバ育名前"
msgid "Oh... Akiyama-san."
msgstr "Ah... Akiyama-san."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "92_Akiyama"
msgid "Hey there. How's the hostess life treating you?  Getting used to it yet?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "104_キャバ育名前"
msgid "Yes! My apartment is amazing. I could spend a whole day there and not feel bored!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "116_Akiyama"
msgid "I'm glad to hear that, but don't forget to call home now and then."
msgstr "Qué bueno oír eso, pero no te olvides de llamar a casa de vez en cuando."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "128_キャバ育名前"
msgid "What!? No! I don't wanna have anything to do with my father anymore! I don't even wanna hear his voice!"
msgstr "¡¿Qué?! ¡No! ¡Ya no quiero tener nada que ver con mi padre! ¡Ya no lo soporto!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "140_Akiyama"
msgid "Aren't your parents paying for your tuition? If you really wanted to cut ties with them, you'd have to quit school."
msgstr "¿Pero tus padres no te pagan tu matrícula? Si de verdad quieres cortar la relación con ellos, tendrías que dejar los estudios."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "152_キャバ育名前"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "164_Akiyama"
msgid "Okay, off to work now! There are lots of folks back at the club who want to see you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_キャバ育名前"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "Está bien."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "188_キャバ育名前"
msgid "I wanna prove that I can make it on my own! I'm gonna do this!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "200_Akiyama"
msgid "(Sounds like a tough situation. Nothing I can really do to help it, though.)"
msgstr "(Qué difícil situación. No puedo hacer nada para poder ayudarla, creo.)"

#. y4:line_status=todo
